repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/kefyusuf/claimbridge-sandbox
url: >-
  https://github.com/kefyusuf/claimbridge-sandbox
abstract: >-
  Stateful sandbox emulating the MEDULA-compatible claim flow
  defined by claimbridge-medula-spec. Loads the published spec
  bundle, maintains episode state, validates requests against
  DVO/rule contracts, detects duplicate invoices, and replays
  scenario contracts. No live SGK connection and no real
  patient data.
keywords:
  - medula
  - sgk
  - healthcare
  - claims
  - sandbox
  - turkish-healthcare
